        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Reticule of  dark red fine knitted silk with dark red satin top through which runs a cord drawstring; decorated top and bottom with a band of 4 rows of tiny beads in dark red, pink, green and dark green; in the centre similar bands edge a band with bead embroidery in the form of pink flowers and dark and light green leaves."@en ;
